":"."}]},{"id":22892,"title":"Zechariah 1:14","segments":["So the angel that communed with me said unto me, Cry thou, saying, Thus saith the LORD of hosts; I am jealous for Jerusalem and for Zion with a great jealousy."],"ref":"Zechariah 1:14","verse":14,"words":[{"text":"So the angel","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" that communed","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" with me said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto me, Cry","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" thou, saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" of hosts","strong":"H6635"},{"text":"; I am jealous","strong":"H7065"},{"text":" for Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":" and for Zion","strong":"H6726"},{"text":" with a great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" jealousy","strong":"H7068"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":22893,"title":"Zechariah 1:15","segments":["And I am very sore displeased with the heathen [that are] at ease: for I was but a little displeased, and they helped forward the affliction."],"ref":"Zechariah 1:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"And I am very","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" sore","strong":"H7110"},{"text":" displeased","strong":"H7107"},{"text":" with the heathen","strong":"H1471"},{"text":" [that are] at ease","strong":"H7600"},{"text":": for I was but a little","strong":"H4592"},{"text":" displeased","strong":"H7107"},{"text":", and they helped","strong":"H5826"},{"text":" forward the affliction","strong":"H7451"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":22894,"title":"Zechariah 1:16","segments":["Therefore thus saith the LORD; I am returned to Jerusalem with mercies: my house shall be built in it, saith the LORD of hosts, and a line shall be stretched forth upon Jerusalem."],"ref":"Zechariah 1:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"Therefore thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":"; I am returned","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" to Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":" with mercies","strong":"H7356"},{"text":": my house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":